nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VMx9_lBiNPkQ7kNvwGqxBe3&_nc_oc=AdmB-k-KcjIxg_RLh4rYXc5i-Rtj8hJvQ9mvcdyIizALynTAC1B1anLNR79aN9ZdqH4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyHcuVvpGWQlVHuuo6S0gZF0tUQ4KuUDmA8HG4swu6jvg&oe=69AEC5E7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FLOculus_TrailerCover2.png", "id": "434900168706817", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974741_434900172040150_3046569544541794558_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-5mufnbSQSEQ7kNvwFV15L-&_nc_oc=Adkm4wc3UMs9f0WIbxP_cdPBK2Dlc0OaKjlVfuUVjz7kmVPEl9gKd3lj674ac0e1Ads&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxfkewKyLxn1vL50zLkOF83SOH8VSMb8hzUbvqjkVVBSg&oe=69AEBB53"}, "display_name": "Floreo", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Floreo uses virtual reality to teach social, communication, behavioral, and life skills to individuals with Autism Spectrum Disorder and related diagnoses. Our immersive VR experiences are based on established, science-backed techniques and designed to be used in therapy, educational, or family settings. \n\nOur standalone version consists of three sensory room experiences: a marimba, an aquarium, and a cave filled with crystals.\n\nEnterprise users can pair with an iPad to access our extensive library of over 175 lessons that teach social, behavioral, communication and life skills in a fun and engaging way. Our clinical team works hand-in-hand with game developers to create evidence-based lessons for individuals with ASD and other diagnoses to safely learn important skills in a controlled virtual reality environment. Floreo is running several research studies, including a study in collaboration with the Center for Autism Research at CHOP and National Institutes of Health.", "short_description": "Virtual Reality to provide calming spaces and to teach emotional regulation."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://floreovr.com/priva